//# script-feature-level(2)

// ==============================================================================
//  Sonic Classic Heroes AIR
// ==============================================================================
//  Brings the team system of Sonic Classic Heroes to Sonic 3 & Knuckles:
//  Sonic, Tails and Knuckles travel together, and the player switches the
//  leader at any time (Speed -> Flight -> Power).
//
//  How it works:
//   - The leader is always the real player 1 object (0xffffb000), with the full
//     original physics, abilities and object interactions of that character.
//     Switching the leader changes that object's character in place.
//   - The two other team members follow the leader by replaying the leader's
//     recent movement, using the game's own animation code and sprites.
//   - The story stays the one of the character selected in the data select.
// ==============================================================================


include heroes/defines
include heroes/team
include heroes/trail
include heroes/followers
include heroes/hud
include heroes/hooks
